        <mxCell id="n3" parent="1" style="text;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;" value="One Go engine. It owns the cart, the order, and the POS ticket. It is the saga: authorize, then capture after the POS accepts. The cart is lines in Postgres (P-31). A guest cart stays on the device. brand_id on every hop." vertex="1">
