        <mxCell id="n44" parent="n10" style="text;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#854D0E;" value="&lt;b&gt;ponytail:&lt;/b&gt; the saga is the status column plus the outbox. A crash retries from the last commit. Upgrade: Temporal, if a step needs a durable timer." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="52" width="968" x="16" y="912" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
