        <mxCell id="n64" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;container=1;collapsible=0;pointerEvents=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="Decisions · what it costs" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="700" x="672" y="1144" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n68" parent="n64" style="text;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="• PlaceOrder is gRPC. The shopper is waiting for authorize_url (P-01, P-09).&lt;br&gt;• Cart is lines in Postgres. Every view calls PriceLines. No expiry (P-31, P-32).&lt;br&gt;• Four sync calls at checkout: store, price, quote, payment. Each one down fails the call." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="672" x="14" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n65" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;container=1;collapsible=0;pointerEvents=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#94A3B8;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="Not this domain" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="652" x="1388" y="1144" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n69" parent="n65" style="text;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Catalog owns the price. Payment owns the charge. Brand &amp; Store owns hours and hidden.&lt;br&gt;Delivery owns the fee and the rider. Identity owns the shopper.&lt;br&gt;Deal stacking is open (O-21). This path does not call Campaign." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="624" x="14" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n70" parent="1" style="text;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#854D0E;" value="&lt;b&gt;Contract&lt;/b&gt;  GetCart and UpdateCart are gRPC. A cart is never on the bus. PlaceOrder carries cart_version, expected_total_satang, and quote_id. order.requested is the aggregator and the POS status. order.events is the lifecycle. placed leaves only after authorized. A wallet order has no redirect. A consume ends in an Ack. The shopper path has no Ack." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="48" width="2020" x="16" y="1360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
